---
/*
  Services hero. Shares the Home hero's gradient, grid and glow so the two
  pages read as one site, but the layout is left-aligned rather than centred
  so the page does not look like a second copy of Home.

  Nav and the Book a call button live in the shared site header.
*/
---

<section class="shero">
  <div class="shero__grid"></div>
  <div class="shero__fade"></div>
  <div class="shero__glow"></div>

  <div class="shero__content">
    <div class="shell shero__body">
      <p class="kicker" data-reveal>What we build</p>

      <h1 data-reveal style="--d: 60ms">
        This isn't a menu. It's one system, in pieces.
      </h1>

      <p class="shero__sub" data-reveal style="--d: 120ms">
        Most agencies hand you a services page like a restaurant menu, pick
        three, pay per item, hope they work together. Ours don't get built that
        way. The AI agent that qualifies your lead reads the same data as the
        CRM that tagged it and the ad that sent it. Pull one piece out and the
        others still work, but they work better together, because that's how
        they were built.
      </p>

      <p class="shero__through" data-reveal style="--d: 180ms">
        Every system starts the same place every business does: leads have to
        actually land somewhere and get tracked. That's the foundation
        everything else gets built on.
      </p>

      <div class="shero__cta" data-reveal style="--d: 240ms">
        <a class="btn btn--accent" href="#packages">
          See the packages <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="#foundation">
          Start with the foundation <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(
      115deg,
      #060608 0%,
      #0b0d1a 45%,
      #131a3a 88%,
      #0f1220 100%
    );
  }

  .shero__grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(46, 52, 80, 0.75) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(46, 52, 80, 0.75) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 84px 84px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 80% 84% at 50% 44%,
      #000 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 50%,
      transparent 94%
    );
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 80% 84% at 50% 44%,
      #000 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 50%,
      transparent 94%
    );
  }

  .shero__fade {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 62% 58% at 50% 48%,
      #0b0d1a 0%,
      rgba(11, 13, 26, 0.86) 42%,
      transparent 78%
    );
  }

  .shero__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 42%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 620px;
    height: 340px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.18) 0%,
      transparent 70%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: sheroGlow 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes sheroGlow {
    from {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.07);
    }
  }

  .shero__content {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Centred, matching the Home hero. Top padding clears the fixed header. */
  .shero__body {
    padding-top: 172px;
    padding-bottom: 108px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 17ch;
    margin: 0 auto 26px;
  }

  .shero__sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.74;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin: 0 auto 26px;
  }

  /*
    Bordered on all sides rather than only the left: a single left rule
    against centred text reads as a mistake.
  */
  .shero__through {
    position: relative;
    padding: 18px 26px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.28);
    background: rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.05);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .shero__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 38px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 940px) {
    /* The header wraps to two rows once the burger appears. */
    .shero__body {
      padding-top: 150px;
      padding-bottom: 76px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .shero__body {
      padding-top: 132px;
      padding-bottom: 56px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .shero__sub {
      font-size: 15.5px;
    }

    .shero__through {
      font-size: 15px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .shero__cta .btn {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .shero__glow {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
